{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:31 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:31 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:31 2026-10-29 HKT</p><img alt=\"舂磡角道42號有住戶報稱失竊千萬美元珠寶，警方調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/39dd455c1e919acced973e47bd508330/2026-10/page_268.jpg\"/><p>今日（29日）下午1時39分，港島南區舂坎角舂磡角道42號紫荊園一名住戶報案，指失竊兩件珠寶，總值1,000萬美元。警員接報到場，正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"舂磡角道42號有住戶報稱失竊千萬美元珠寶。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb129400cf068e30d315b86f6b4bc3ea/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_04_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92df3a72a42aa5474a72f7fd61e6a409/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee3d583365d7667692b3bfe25644bda4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d9ddca87e70515b2879a25f3823d4dd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_03_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31b0a1fa1b18573abc72bcaafebd6fb9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_03_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f37e348a6451a89cdd60ead9ea311db1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是舂磡角道42號紫荊園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1e75dd3f192a791ea7a10930118490e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_02_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b13c937c1bd40f49825574843d1d576/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_36_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"舂磡角道42號有住戶報稱失竊千萬美元珠寶，警方調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07d834e94e3fe2ece5f2d1c2306fb158/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_36_00.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42b841b63910b8e53ef501b645ff730a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_15_17_02.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方接報到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaf6ea7a6ab7